[Desktop Entry]
Name=Security
Name[de]=Sicherheit
Name[fr]=Sécurité
Name[es]=Seguridad
Name[it]=Sicurezza
Name[pt]=Segurança
Name[nl]=Beveiliging
Name[pl]=Bezpieczeństwo
Name[ru]=Безопасность
Comment=Screen lock, encryption, boot chain, connections and known vulnerabilities
Comment[de]=Bildschirmsperre, Verschlüsselung, Startkette, Verbindungen und bekannte Schwachstellen
Comment[fr]=Verrouillage, chiffrement, chaîne de démarrage, connexions et vulnérabilités connues
Comment[es]=Bloqueo de pantalla, cifrado, cadena de arranque, conexiones y vulnerabilidades conocidas
Comment[it]=Blocco schermo, crittografia, catena di avvio, connessioni e vulnerabilità note
Comment[pt]=Bloqueio do ecrã, encriptação, cadeia de arranque, ligações e vulnerabilidades conhecidas
Comment[nl]=Schermvergrendeling, versleuteling, opstartketen, verbindingen en bekende kwetsbaarheden
Comment[pl]=Blokada ekranu, szyfrowanie, łańcuch rozruchu, połączenia i znane podatności
Comment[ru]=Блокировка экрана, шифрование, цепочка загрузки, соединения и известные уязвимости
Exec=gnome-control-center security
Icon=org.gnome.Settings-device-security-symbolic
Terminal=false
Type=Application
NoDisplay=true
StartupNotify=true
Categories=GNOME;GTK;Settings;X-GNOME-Settings-Panel;X-GNOME-DetailsSettings;
OnlyShowIn=GNOME;Unity;
Keywords=Security;Device Security;Encryption;Boot;Vulnerabilities;CVE;Connections;Network;
Keywords[de]=Sicherheit;Gerätesicherheit;Verschlüsselung;Start;Schwachstellen;CVE;Verbindungen;Netzwerk;
